<td id="S3.T1.2.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S3.T1.2.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#ECECEC;">Low-quality letter due to injected instructions</span></td></tr>
